<title>UK: Cerinvest sets $75 million three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Cerinvest sets $75 million three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager BIL and Cera Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CERINVEST</p>
<p> GARANTOR   CERA BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $75 MLN	 COUPON     6.375     MATURITY    29.AUG.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.39    PAY DATE    29.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    100.2025  SPREAD	+22 BP</p>
</text>
